    "updated_at": "2026-03-15T17:45:47Z",
    "body": "The following two points should be considered.\n  Currently, is the percentage of user agents that do not support button element very small?\n  Currently, aren't there a large amount of web pages using ```<input type=\"button|image|submit|reset\">```?\n",
