    "created_at": "2026-03-15T19:05:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-15T19:08:27Z",
    "body": "\"Currently, is the percentage of user agents that do not support button element very small?\"\nI would assume yes, all browsers support them?\n\n\"Currently, aren't there a large amount of web pages using <input type=\"button|image|submit|reset\">?\"\n[InputTypeButton](https://chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/2853) 6.6%, [InputTypeSubmit](https://chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/591) 21.2%, [InputTypeReset](https://chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/2855) 0.12%\n\nTo be clear I know these will probably never be unshippable, but I think it could be useful to mark them as obsolete to at least discourage new usage.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
