    "updated_at": "2026-03-15T21:00:33Z",
    "body": "A feature with a 20% usage rate would be difficult to obsolete unless it is highly harmful.\nMost people won't bother modify code of web pages they created in the past, even if some element would be obsoleted, but if the element is not harmful. \n",
