    "created_at": "2026-03-16T11:40:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-16T11:40:06Z",
    "body": "`marquee` is presentational. That's why it's not allowed.\n\nI think it's worth discussing, but I don't think this is worth the churn for web developers. There's more important issues to address. I think we should mostly not add new features to these buttons, although `appearance: base` should be made to work I think. (Although perhaps it's reasonable if there are some limitations, but not sure if that's even necessary.)",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
