    "created_at": "2026-03-16T15:03:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-16T15:03:37Z",
    "body": "Right. We will likely never remove these code paths. `<input type=button>` will always work, but obsolescence could look something like:\n\n- These input types won't support command/commandfor.\n- They won't support interestfor\n- `appearance:base` does nothing to these (or is the equivalent of `appearance:none`).\n- To that end, from this point forward any new mechanics added to `<button>` will _not_ be added to these input types.\n- Also to that end, from this point forward, any new mechanics added to form controls _generally_ (e.g. appearance:base, or some new ideas) will not be added to these input types unless it's _more_ effort for us to exclude them.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
