    "created_at": "2026-03-16T17:27:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-16T17:27:12Z",
    "body": "I don't think we should exclude them from `appearance: base`. You could have hundreds of pages of markup that include these controls or more and want to restyle those. Requiring to redo all the markup as well would be extremely annoying. They also shouldn't be harder than `<button>` really.",
