    "updated_at": "2026-03-20T04:24:48Z",
    "body": "One of the reasons to use an `<input type=submit>` is its support for the `formtarget` and other `form*` attributes which are unique to that type of input.\n\nThat leads me to believe that people will still actively use them if they need to, as there is no other way (that doesn't require script) to do that.",
